      "locked": false,
      "text": "Collection is an Interface available in package java.util,\nacts as a super parent of all collection classes as \nArrayList, LinkedList and hashSet etc.\n\nCollections is a class in java.util package ,it is a utility class as it has only\nstatic methods to perform utility operations collection classes.\n\nSome of its popular methods are sort(), copy(), binarySearch().\n\n",
